    "Q5_dependencies": "Whewell's consilience framework, Hebrew lexicography, ANE cosmology, GCP/PEAR data validity, John 1:1-14 exegesis",
    "Q6_consequences": "Weakens the claim that biblical texts predict modern physics; suggests retrospective eisegesis; the Logos correspondence remains interesting but limited",
    "Q7_kill": "If Hebrew natah definitively means 'spread like a tent' (not 'expand'), if ANE parallels are found, if GCP/PEAR data fails replication, if Logos is shown to be entirely different from information"
